return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:46+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:46+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'将此站点的媒体库移动到 Zinn® 对象存储并通过 CDN 进行提供。通过您的 Zinn® 控制面板进行配置 — 无需在 WordPress 中输入任何访问密钥。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已保存。请输入新值进行替换。','Filter this list…'=>'筛选此列表……','Filter this list'=>'筛选此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有符合该筛选条件的项。','Add a row'=>'添加行','Remove this row'=>'删除此行','Remove'=>'移除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Overview'=>'概览','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'此站点上的每个 Zinn® 插件及其运行状态。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件不需要连接。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复默认设置','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这会将该插件的所有设置恢复为默认值。是否继续？','Diagnostics for support'=>'支持诊断','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Import'=>'导入','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件中绝不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥——您需要在新网站上重新输入这些信息。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'该插件的所有设置已恢复为默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'该操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件太大，无法作为设置导出。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从另一个插件 (%s) 导出的，因此在此处导入它将存储该插件无法识别的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 个设置。密码和 API 密钥不会包含在导出文件中，请重新输入。','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® 未返回令牌。此网站未作任何更改。','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'此网站已不再连接至 Zinn® 媒体卸载。新上传的文件将保留在此服务器上。请从您的 Zinn Digital® 控制面板中重新配对。','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® 的响应返回了 HTTP %d。','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'已被 Zinn Digital® 断开连接。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接……','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有些问题需要处理','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'使用您自己的账户','We could not check this'=>'我们无法对此进行检查','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'此插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'上次检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新标签页中打开）','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'发送给 Zinn® 客服','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'这就是将要发送的内容——没有别的，也没有隐藏内容。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在其中。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送至 Zinn® 支持团队','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们将为您创建一个支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如