进行更改不会影响已经迁移的媒体文件——其地址保持不变。','New uploads'=>'新上传内容','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'将新上传的内容实时移至 Zinn® 存储空间','Existing media'=>'现有媒体','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'继续移动已在此处的媒体库','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'每小时几个文件，在后台运行，并在中断处继续。关闭此功能会将其暂停；已移动的文件不会被传回。','Files per hourly pass'=>'每小时文件处理数','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'每个附件包含数个文件，且每一个都是完整的上传。请将此调高至执行限制宽松的高速主机上；若传输过程被提前中断，则将其调低。','Leave files smaller than'=>'保留小于以下大小的文件','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'千字节。一个小图标在额外连接上花费的成本超过了它在磁盘上节省的成本，因此很少有理由移动它。设置为 0 以移动所有内容。','Never move these types'=>'切勿移动这些类型','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'在插件直接从磁盘读取文件时非常有用——例如字体、表单生成器加盖图章的 PDF，或是播放器在其中搜寻的音频文件。','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'这两个需要特别注意——在修改之前，请先阅读各自的描述。','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'使用 Zinn® 存储提供服务','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'将图片和文件地址指向 Zinn® 存储空间','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'关闭：文件已上传，但仍由此服务器提供服务——在您检查所有内容是否已送达时，这是安全的状态。开启：访客将从存储获取服务，此服务器不再承载流量。','Free the disk space'=>'释放磁盘空间','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'在每个尺寸上传完成后删除本地副本','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'这就是离盘点的核心所在，这也是不可逆转的一半。在“从 Zinn® 存储提供服务”（Serve from Zinn® storage）开启且您已检查过网站之前，请勿开启此项——如果遗漏了任何内容，本地副本将是拯救您的唯一方法。','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'删除本地副本的操作在此界面中无法撤销。请先进行备份——Zinn® Connector 插件可以为您完成此操作。','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'本网站尚未连接到 Zinn® 存储，因此无可用于移动媒体的位置。','%d attachment moved.'=>'已移动 %d 个附件。','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'本网站与 Zinn® 存储无关。','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'一切正常 — 只是尚未配对。在此之前，媒体将保留在此服务器上。','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'已连接，但上次上传失败。','Try a batch now'=>'立即尝试批量处理','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'已连接。所有附件均已移动。','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'已连接。%1$s / %2$s 个附件仍在此服务器上。','Moved so far'=>'已迁移数量','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'%1$s 个文件，%2$s','Still on this server'=>'依然在此服务器上','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%2$s 个附件中的 %1$s 个','Served from'=>'托管自','this server'=>'此服务器','Connect this site'=>'连接此网站','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Storage → Media offload, and press “Pair a site”. Paste the code below.'=>'打开您的 Zinn Digital® 控制面板，前往“存储”→“媒体卸载”，然后点击“配对网站”。粘贴下方的代码。','Pairing code'=>'配对码','Disconnect this site'=>'断开此站点连接','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'新上传的文件将保留在此服务器上。已移动的媒体文件将继续正常工作——其地址不会改变。','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'您没有权限管理此网站。','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'从您的 Zinn Digital® 控制面板粘贴配对码。','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'已连接。从现在起，新的上传内容将存储在 Zinn Digital® 中，您现有的媒体文件将在后台迁移。','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'已断开连接。已移动的媒体仍可正常使用；新上传的内容将保留在此服务器上。','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'无法从此服务器读取该文件，因此未上传任何内容。','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'此网站无法流式传输上传内容，因此未发送任何数据。','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'此文件的的大小为 %1$s，而此网站的 PHP 未启用 cURL，因此最大可上传大小为 %2$s。','The upload could not be completed.'=>'无法完成上传。','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'存储拒绝上传 (HTTP %d)。','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'一个起点。其下的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'不勾选此项，预设将完全按原样使用。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'请参阅 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'已下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，因此未进行安装。']];